        <ns1:obsoleted_in_version>1.4</ns1:obsoleted_in_version>
        <rdfs:comment>This property was not in use anywhere in the ontology. Further, it had no definition and therefore its intended usage was unclear. Until a time when this property is required and an official definition created, this property is obsolete so as not to introduce inconsistent usage.</rdfs:comment>
